Z||000000||80's BOY||10-18-2001||01:12 PM||||i for the first time am letting a shop do work on my precious 8g GT Targa. i have a tranny that needs to be put in to replace the one in there. they are both autos.<P>what seals, boots, etc. should i expect to replace when doing the swap?? i want to limit my downtime and order ahead. the same drive shafts are being used from the old to the new tranny, and i am also having the shop go through the filters.<P>has anyone done this lately to answer my question?? thanks in advance.||||reg||5
Z||000001||Old Lar||10-18-2001||04:47 PM||||If you are having a shop do it, why not them order the parts that are necessary?  As they tear it apart, they will determine what is needed. Thats why you pay them the big bucks.  Why should you buy parts that may not be needed.||||reg||1
Z||000002||80's BOY||10-18-2001||05:40 PM||||1) I don't want to have to wait that long. I want to walk in with the parts in hand thus saving the shop and myself time and money.<P>2) I don't trust anybody to do mechanic work. The only reason I am having this done is because I work too much and dont have the time.<P>3) The shop may order from some idiot that thinks all fieros burned up because they all caught on fire. I can order from who I want. Thus saving me time and money again.<P>So mostly, to save me TIME AND MONEY.||||reg||2
Z||000003||theogre||10-18-2001||07:10 PM||||Replace TC input seal and the axle seals. That's about is for any normal swap. <P>The filter kits come with a new gasket.<P>You might want to replace the axle bearings while it's out... Those need to be done rather carefully. You need a driver for the new ones. I'm not sure what you need to get the old ones out on th125.<P>The seals and filter you can do yourself before you take the tranny to be installed. That shouldn't take more than an hour... <P>Get some new rubber cooler line and clamps. <P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/fullstaff.gif">  <FONT COLOR="blue"><I><B>11-Sept-01, The day the world as we knew it ended.</B></I></FONT>||||reg||1
